 farms.\r\ncontainer.sim.traits11=Loves the Outdoors\r\ncontainer.sim.traits12=Folk that love the outdoors love taking leisurely strolls. They love open spaces, and working outside will make their day.\r\ncontainer.sim.traits13=Night Owl\r\ncontainer.sim.traits14=Night Owl folk won't spend much time indoors upon nightfall. They will wander during the night. Night Owl folk will continue terraforming and building work throughout the night.\r\ncontainer.sim.traits15=Religious\r\ncontainer.sim.traits16=Religious folk like to visit church daily to pray. Being unable to do so makes them unhappy. Make sure you build a church in your town.\r\ncontainer.sim.traits17=Church\r\ncontainer.sim.traits18=Attending Church\r\ncontainer.sim.traits19=Strong\r\ncontainer.sim.traits20=Strong folk can perform manual labour faster. Be it mining, cutting wood, building or digging sand.\r\ncontainer.sim.traits21=Workaholic\r\ncontainer.sim.traits22=Workaholic folk enjoy working, and will develop skills twice as fast as an ordinary folk. Unemployment makes these folk unhappy. Keep those employment rates up!\r\ncontainer.sim.ATTACKING=attacking\r\ncontainer.sim.ARRIVEDATFARM=arrived at farm\r\ncontainer.sim.ONPATROL=Patrolling\r\ncontainer.sim.SHEARING=Shearing sheep\r\ncontainer.sim.WAITINGFORWOOL=waiting for wool\r\ncontainer.sim.BEAMINGUP=beaming up\r\ncontainer.sim.MINING=mining\r\ncontainer.sim.BEAMINGDOWN=beaming down\r\ncontainer.sim.WAITINGFORCHEST=No chests nearby!\r\ncontainer.sim.job.crop.farmer.Tending=Tending crops\r\ncontainer.sim.job.crop.farmer.Tending1=Tending\r\ncontainer.sim.RETURNCLAY=return clay\r\ncontainer.sim.COLLECTCLAY=collect block\r\ncontainer.sim.GOTOCLAYBLOCK=go to block\r\ncontainer.sim.SCANFORCLAY=scan for clay\r\ncontainer.sim.RETURNWOOD=return wood\r\ncontainer.sim.CHOPPINGTREE=Chopping wood\r\ncontainer.sim.GOTOTREE=Finding wood\r\ncontainer.sim.SCANFORTREE=scan for tree\r\ncontainer.sim.ARRIVEDATMILL=arrived at mill\r\ncontainer.sim.SLAUGHTERING=slaughterin