rs\r\ncontainer.sim.PICKUPCHEESE=pick up cheese\r\ncontainer.sim.PICKUPGROCERY=pick up grocery\r\ncontainer.sim.PICKUPBAKERY=pick up bakery\r\ncontainer.sim.NOINGREDIANTS=no ingrediants\r\ncontainer.sim.MAKEFOOD=make food\r\ncontainer.sim.ARRIVEDATSTORE=arrived at store\r\ncontainer.sim.INSTORE=in store\r\ncontainer.sim.SELLINGBREAD=selling bread\r\ncontainer.sim.MAKEBREAD=make bread\r\ncontainer.sim.GOBACKTOBAKERY=go back to bakery\r\ncontainer.sim.COLLECTINGWHEAT=collecting wheat\r\ncontainer.sim.GOINGTOWHEATFARM=going to wheat farm\r\ncontainer.sim.ARRIVEDATSHOP=arrived at shop\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.building.piston=piston\r\ncontainer.sim.building.button=button\r\ncontainer.sim.change_credits=change credits <amount>\r\ncontainer.sim.sim_gui_rms=Sim Letter of appointment\r\ncontainer.sim.sim_gui_zw0=Adventurer, when you are tired of taking risks, you can try to accept this appointment.\r\ncontainer.sim.sim_gui_zw1=It can help you become the only speaker in the city. You can hire NPC to work for you. They can become architects,\r\ncontainer.sim.sim_gui_zw2=planners, bakers, farmers, butchers, shepherds, chicken farmers,cattle breeders, soldiers, glass manufacturers,\r\ncontainer.sim.sim_gui_zw3=brick workers and many other professions. To help you make a contribution to your city,at first you only have 10 points of capital.\r\ncontainer.sim.sim_gui_zw4= If you want to develop the city better, you have to find your own way to do the rest. Come on adventurers!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.not_accept=not accept\r\ncontainer.sim.accept=accept\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader0=This enables or disables the beaming effect (purple particles) - Set to true to turn them off.\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader1=If the folks BLARG talking gets annoying, set this to false\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader2=If the folks ENGLISH talking gets annoying, set this to false\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader3=The radius in blocks that the lumberjack will look for trees from the starting point, don't set this too high, otherwise it will slow down MC every time they scan for the nearest tree, so 30 to 1000 should be ok (1000 is 1 Kilometre)\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader4=Limit the population from growing beyond this number if you have an older computer\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader5=When placing a marker it fires out 4 alignment beams, setting this to false will turn those beams off\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader6=If you think the mining/farming boxes are too cheap/overpowered, set this to true to make the recipies require diamond tools instead of stone tools\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader7=When a builder runs out of materials, they will let you know about it every 3 minutes, set to 0 for no further reminders.\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader8=This positions the HUD (population and money text at the top of the screen) - default is 0, which is the top, value is in pixels, so setting 320 will display it 320 pixels from the top of the screen. Alter this to suit your screen resolution and avoid clashing with other text, setting to minus 10 will display it offscreen.\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader9=This is just a personal mod :-) If you too find it rains ALL THE F***ING TIME in your world and it annoys you/causes lag, set this to true and you'll only have brief showers instead\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader10=These are the male first names used by the random name generator, keep the format the same or bad things will happen.\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader11=These are the female first names used by the random name generator, keep the format the same or bad things will happen.\r\ncontainer.sim.config_loader12=These are the last names used by the random name generator, keep the format the same or bad things will happen.\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.race_dark_elf=Dark Elf\r\ncontainer.sim.race_dark_elf_Desc=Dark elves are distant ancestors of the highland elves.\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.race_elf=Elf\r\ncontainer.sim.race_elf_Desc=Dark elves are distant ancestors of the highland elves.\r\ncontainer.sim.race_Human=Human\r\ncontainer.sim.race_Human_Desc=Humans are the generic race of sentient life that inhabit Planet Earth. How they reached Minecraftia is still unknown.\r\ncontainer.sim.race_Orc=Orc\r\ncontainer.sim.race_Orc_Desc=Orcs may seem frightening, and can be when they want to, but are almost always gentle creatures.\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.npcData_onupdate1= has moved in to\r\ncontainer.sim.npcData_onupdate2= with their parents\r\ncontainer.sim.npcData_onupdate3= has moved int\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.hire_elsewhere=was hired elsewhere, try hiring a different folk\r\ncontainer.sim.gui.block_controller_Occupants=Occupants\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.job_baker1=Unpacking baking tools\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_could=could not find any buildings to collect from\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Collecting_materials=Collecting materials\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Unloading_inventory=Unloading inventory\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Returning_to_work=Returning to work\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Selling=Selling\r\ncontainer.sim.job_farmer_has=has just levelled up to Farmer Level\r\ncontainer.sim.job_farmer_Length=Length\r\ncontainer.sim.job_farmer_Width=Width\r\ncontainer.sim.GOTOSANDBLOCK1=Go find the materials\r\ncontainer.sim.job_Livestock_pig=pig\r\ncontainer.sim.job_Livestock_cow=cow\r\ncontainer.sim.job_Livestock_sheep=sheep\r\ncontainer.sim.job_Livestock_chicken=chicken\r\ncontainer.sim.job_Livestock_rabbit=rabbit\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Spawn1=Spawning livestock\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Butcher1=Butchering animal\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_PlaceInChest1=Put the harvested items into the box\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Fisherman=Can't find water\r\ncontainer.sim.job_task_Fisherman1=cannot find any water to fish in. Try rebuilding the dock closer to water\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.job.Grocer1=groceries\r\n\r\ncontainer.sim.Command1=Simulated City has already started, you cannot currently change gamemode\r\ncontainer.sim.Command2=Invalid arguments, should 